        <mxCell id="bar3" value="&lt;b&gt;Cost guardrails — $100 student credit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px;color:#333333'&gt;serverless-only workspace, so no idle billing (D-32)   ·   measured: ~35 s notebook + 40-60 s env floor (D-38)   ·   ~90% of the work ran local at $0   ·   Databricks: 3 job runs, 60-94 s&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=label;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCI+PHBhdGggZD0iTTkuNiAyLjUgMyAxOC4ybDQuNi4xTDE0LjYgMi41eiIgZmlsbD0iIzAwNzhENCIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0xMi40IDYuNCAyMS41IDIxLjVINi45bDYtMi4yLTMuMy00eiIgZmlsbD0iIzAwNzhENCIgb3BhY2l0eT0iLjciLz48L3N2Zz4=;imageWidth=20;imageHeight=20;imageAlign=left;imageVerticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=40;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
